  "label": "Religious Extremism",
  "description": "The belief or practice of adhering to a strict, often intolerant interpretation of religious doctrine. The meme uses the visual of an angry, shouting man to symbolize religious extremism, which is a real-world phenomenon often associated with radicalization, sectarian violence, and the rejection of other faiths. This concept is central to understanding the meme’s critique of intolerance.",
